here with you guys.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:21.415
MARK MANDEL: Excellent decision.

00:20:21.415 --> 00:20:24.550
DANIEL CUKIER: And
now the real answer.

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:29.570
So it's cool to have access
