00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:33.250
So before the products get
launched-- so we can plan

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:36.370
and maybe when we
know before anyone,

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:40.330
we can-- OK, let's wait because
Google will launch something

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:45.100
in the next month or instead of
trying to tackle this problem

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:48.370
and do a lot of work
on that, we can wait.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:52.900
And so having privilege
information about that is cool.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:56.650
And also having access
to many other developers,

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:02.260
other experts, it's great
because we can change knowledge

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.590
and this is wonderful.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:06.410
FRANCESC CAMPOY: And
one last question--

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.451
what is your favorite product
or feature of Google Cloud

00:21:09.451 --> 00:21:09.950
Platform?

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.730
DANIEL CUKIER: One feature that
I think is very interesting

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:16.430
is the preemptible instances.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.340
So we use a lot.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:23.450
So we could actually-- and I
wrote a blog post about it--

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:29.530
could decrease our costs
in 40% after moving

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:35.260
part of our infrastructure
to preemptible instances.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:37.170
And compared to
others, for example,

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:40.020
compared to spot
instances in Amazon,

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:47.180
it's a lot better because you
have all this complex speed

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:51.490
things that you need to do
and preemptible is much more

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:55.930
predictable, so you know
that the service will go down

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:59.080
in the next 24 hours,
so you plan for it

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:02.360
and you already know how much
you're going to pay for that.

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:03.782
So this is great.

00:22:03.782 --> 00:22:04.740
MARK MANDEL: All right.

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:06.110
Daniel, thank you so
much for joining us

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:08.401
