00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:54.900
DIDIER GERARD: So you ask
me for my favorite products.

00:23:54.900 --> 00:23:57.637
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Yes, or feature.

00:23:57.637 --> 00:23:58.720
DIDIER GERARD: I have two.

00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:02.860
App Engines-- I love
App Engines because it

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:06.570
helps to build very
scalable applications

00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:08.660
and it's very easy to do that.

00:24:08.660 --> 00:24:11.500
For example, I have
built applications

00:24:11.500 --> 00:24:16.280
for clients who want to
scale from zero to millions

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:22.340
