one is BigQuery

00:24:25.300 --> 00:24:27.280
because, for the
same reason, you

00:24:27.280 --> 00:24:32.500
can have queries that
run billions of lines

00:24:32.500 --> 00:24:34.890
and you have the result
in a few seconds.

00:24:34.890 --> 00:24:35.490
All of that.

00:24:35.490 --> 00:24:38.500
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah, I got
to say that one of the times

00:24:38.500 --> 00:24:40.910
