00:24:40.910 --> 00:24:43.740
I went to one of your trainings,
one of your BigQuery trainings.

00:24:43.740 --> 00:24:45.710
It was pretty
amazing, I got to say.

00:24:45.710 --> 00:24:48.107
I know BigQuery and
I was impressed.

