people in training.

00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:50.580
MARK MANDEL: That's
very, very nice.

00:25:50.580 --> 00:25:53.190
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah,
that is more than me.

00:25:53.190 --> 00:25:54.180
MARK MANDEL: You gotta
