thanks for remembering it.

00:27:30.120 --> 00:27:31.495
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
I remember that.

00:27:31.495 --> 00:27:32.079
I reviewed it.

00:27:32.079 --> 00:27:33.578
KRISHNAN S. P. T.:
Oh yeah, you did.

00:27:33.578 --> 00:27:34.320
Thank you.

00:27:34.320 --> 00:27:37.300
So I wrote the first book on
the Google Cloud Platform.

00:27:37.300 --> 00:27:40.330
It was called "Building Your
Next Big Thing On Google Cloud

00:27:40.330 --> 00:27:40.830
