00:28:11.857 --> 00:28:13.940
MARK MANDEL: Yeah by the
time you finish the book,

00:28:13.940 --> 00:28:14.523
also we have--

00:28:14.523 --> 00:28:15.660
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:28:15.660 --> 00:28:17.730
MARK MANDEL:
--everything changes.

