multivendors kind of thing

00:28:43.560 --> 00:28:46.514
and I presented about the
Google Cloud Platform there.

00:28:46.514 --> 00:28:47.430
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cool.

00:28:47.430 --> 00:28:50.409
So you mentioned that
you've been part of the GDE

00:28:50.409 --> 00:28:51.450
