00:28:54.090 --> 00:28:56.080
FRANCESC CAMPOY: What is your
favorite part of being a GDE?

00:28:56.080 --> 00:28:57.705
KRISHNAN S. P. T.:
OK, my favorite part

00:28:57.705 --> 00:29:00.060
