test new technologies

00:29:00.060 --> 00:29:03.240
and to give direct feedback
to the program managers--

00:29:03.240 --> 00:29:04.050
product managers.

00:29:04.050 --> 00:29:06.330
That's my favorite
part of being a GDE

00:29:06.330 --> 00:29:10.260
and that's where we feel
that we are valued so much.

00:29:10.260 --> 00:29:11.850
And we are a small
group of people

00:29:11.850 --> 00:29:16.480
who are valued by Google
as a company itself

00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:19.650
where they're trusting us
with all these upcoming things

00:29:19.650 --> 00:29:21.990
and we can give the
feedback, and in many cases

00:29:21.990 --> 00:29:23.870
our feedback actually
productized--

00:29:23.870 --> 00:29:26.041
