about things,

00:29:35.340 --> 00:29:36.740
which is pretty awesome.

00:29:36.740 --> 00:29:37.740
KRISHNAN S. P. T.: Yeah.

00:29:37.740 --> 00:29:39.734
So it's a really open
discussion, even today,

00:29:39.734 --> 00:29:41.150
and I enjoyed every
single session

00:29:41.150 --> 00:29:43.639
where I guess we didn't even
have a Q&amp;A at the end of it

00:29:43.639 --> 00:29:45.430
